    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Escape From Spikes is a platformer that will test your patience from time to time. It looks easy to play but you will see that it is not. Good Luck.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rules are Simple</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect the Gems. Take the key and open the door. Watch out for Spikes while doing so.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rules</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spikes will kill you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You have 3 + 1 Life per level.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect the gold.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get the key.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Open the exit door. </p>",
